fundamentalRep[a[k_Integer]]/;k>0:=fundamentalRep[a[k]]=Module[{out=SparseArray[Module[{posLat=RotateRight/@Prepend@@@Transpose[{#,Range[Length[#]]}]&@Flatten[Table[{j,k+1-m+j},{m,k},{j,m}],1],cartan},cartan=Join@@(Function[{j},{#1,Length[posLat]+j,#1}->#2/(k+1)&@@@Transpose[{Range[k+1],Join[(k+1-j)&/@Range[j],-(j)&/@Range[k+1-j]]}]]/@Range[k]);Join[#->1&/@posLat,cartan,{#3,2Length[posLat]+k+1-#2,#1}->1&@@@Reverse[posLat]]]],adj},adj=inducedAdjoint[out];Set[adjointRep[a[k]],adj];Set[cartan[a[k]],Module[{cartanMetric=repTrace[cartanGenerators[adj],2,False],invMetric},invMetric=inverse[cartanMetric];invMetric . SparseArray[DiagonalMatrix[(2/Normal@Diagonal[invMetric])]]]];Set[weightMetric[a[k]],Module[{cart=repTrace[cartanGenerators[out],2,False]},(1/(2Max[#])DiagonalMatrix[#]) . cart . ((DiagonalMatrix[#]))&@Diagonal[inverse@cart]]];Set[killingMetric[a[k]],repTrace[out,2,False]];Set[representationAlgebra[out],a[k]];Set[tools`normalRepresentationQ[out],True];Set[tools`normalRepresentationQ[adj],True];Set[representationAlgebra[out],a[k]];Set[representationAlgebra[adj],a[k]];Set[tools`stylizedRepData[out],{"F","f",a[k],w[a]@@PadRight[{1},k],RGBColor[0.2,0.2,0.6]}];Set[tools`drawTensor[out],tools`graphicalDotPower[w[a]@@PadRight[{1},k],3]];Set[tools`drawTensor[adj],tools`graphicalDotPower[adjointDynkinLabel[a[k]],3]];Set[tools`stylizedRepData[adj],{"ad","\[GothicG]",a[k],adjointDynkinLabel[a[k]],RGBColor[0.6,0.2,0.3]}];out];
fundamentalRep[b[k_Integer]]/;k>1:=fundamentalRep[b[k]]=Module[{out,seedList=SparseArray[#,{2k+1,2k+1}]&/@Join@@Table[{{2k-j+m+1,1+m}->If[m==0,1,-1],{-1-m,j+1-m}->If[j+1-m==k+1,2,1]},{j,2 k-1},{m,0,Floor[(j-1)/2]}],seed2,cart,seed,ord,adj},cart=SparseArray[Join@@({{#,#}->1,{-#,-#}->-1}&/@Range[#]),{2k+1,2k+1}]&/@Range[k];seed=Transpose[SparseArray@Join[seedList,cart,Reverse[Which[MemberQ[#["NonzeroValues"],2],If[ArrayRules[#][[2,1,1]]==2k+1,1,-1]Reverse[Reverse/@#],MemberQ[#["NonzeroValues"],-1],-Reverse[Reverse/@#],True,Transpose[#]]&/@seedList]],{2,1,3}];out=seed[[All,Ordering[{-Total[Normal@#],-Normal[#]}&/@representationRoots[inducedAdjoint[seed]]],All]];adj=inducedAdjoint[out];Set[adjointRep[b[k]],adj];Set[cartan[b[k]],Module[{cartanMetric=repTrace[cartanGenerators[adj],2,False],invMetric},invMetric=inverse[cartanMetric];invMetric . SparseArray[DiagonalMatrix[(2/Normal@Diagonal[invMetric])]]]];Set[weightMetric[b[k]],Module[{cartan=repTrace[cartanGenerators[out],2,False]},(1/(2Max[#])DiagonalMatrix[#]) . cartan . ((DiagonalMatrix[#]))&@Diagonal[inverse@cartan]]];Set[killingMetric[b[k]],repTrace[out,2,False]];Set[tools`normalRepresentationQ[out],True];Set[tools`normalRepresentationQ[adj],True];Set[representationAlgebra[out],b[k]];Set[representationAlgebra[adj],b[k]];Set[tools`stylizedRepData[out],{"F","f",b[k],w[b]@@PadRight[{1},k],RGBColor[0.2,0.2,0.6]}];Set[tools`drawTensor[out],tools`graphicalDotPower[w[b]@@PadRight[{1},k],3]];Set[tools`drawTensor[adj],tools`graphicalDotPower[adjointDynkinLabel[b[k]],3]];Set[tools`stylizedRepData[adj],{"ad","\[GothicG]",b[k],adjointDynkinLabel[b[k]],RGBColor[0.6,0.2,0.3]}];out];
fundamentalRep[c[k_Integer]]/;k>2:=fundamentalRep[c[k]]=Module[{out,seedList=SparseArray[#,{2k,2k}]&/@Join[Table[{{2k+1-j,j}->1},{j,k}],{{2k-#2+1,#1}->1,{2k-(#1)+1,#2}->1}&@@@Subsets[Range[k],{2}],{{k-#1+1,#2-#1}->-1,{2k-(#2)+2+#1-1,k+#1}->1}&@@@Subsets[Range[k],{2}]],cart,seed,ord,adj},cart=Append[SparseArray[Join@@({{#,#}->1,{-#,-#}->-1}&/@Range[#]),{2k,2k}]&/@Range[k-1],SparseArray[Join@@({{#,#}->1/2,{-#,-#}->-1/2}&/@Range[k]),{2k,2k}]];seed=Transpose[SparseArray@Join[seedList,cart,Reverse[Transpose/@seedList]],{2,1,3}];out=seed[[All,Ordering[{-Total[Normal@#],-Normal[#]}&/@representationRoots[inducedAdjoint[seed]]],All]];adj=inducedAdjoint[out];Set[adjointRep[c[k]],adj];Set[cartan[c[k]],Module[{cartanMetric=repTrace[cartanGenerators[adj],2,False],invMetric},invMetric=inverse[cartanMetric];invMetric . SparseArray[DiagonalMatrix[(2/Normal@Diagonal[invMetric])]]]];Set[weightMetric[c[k]],Module[{cartan=repTrace[cartanGenerators[out],2,False]},(1/(2Max[#])DiagonalMatrix[#]) . cartan . ((DiagonalMatrix[#]))&@Diagonal[inverse@cartan]]];Set[killingMetric[c[k]],repTrace[out,2,False]];Set[tools`normalRepresentationQ[out],True];Set[tools`normalRepresentationQ[adj],True];Set[representationAlgebra[out],c[k]];Set[representationAlgebra[adj],c[k]];Set[tools`drawTensor[adj],tools`graphicalDotPower[adjointDynkinLabel[c[k]],3]];Set[tools`stylizedRepData[adj],{"ad","\[GothicG]",c[k],adjointDynkinLabel[c[k]],RGBColor[0.6,0.2,0.3]}];Set[tools`stylizedRepData[out],{"F","f",c[k],w[c]@@PadRight[{1},k],RGBColor[0.2,0.2,0.6]}];Set[tools`drawTensor[out],tools`graphicalDotPower[w[c]@@PadRight[{1},k],3]];out];
fundamentalRep[d[k_Integer]]/;k>3:=fundamentalRep[d[k]]=Module[{out,seedList=SparseArray[#,{2k,2k}]&/@Join@@Table[{{2k-j+m,1+m}->If[m==0,1,-1],{-1-m,j+1-m}->1},{j,2(k-1)},{m,0,Floor[(j-1)/2]}],cart,seed,ord,adj},cart=Join[SparseArray[Join@@({{#,#}->1,{-#,-#}->-1}&/@Range[#]),{2k,2k}]&/@Range[k-2],{SparseArray[Join@@({{#,#}->1/2,{-#,-#}->-1/2}&/@Range[k]),{2k,2k}],SparseArray[Join@@{Join@@({{#,#}->1/2,{-#,-#}->-1/2}&/@Range[k-1]),{{k,k}->-1/2,{k+1,k+1}->1/2}},{2k,2k}]}];seed=Transpose[SparseArray@Join[seedList,cart,Reverse[Transpose/@seedList]],{2,1,3}];out=seed[[All,Ordering[{-Total[Normal@#],-Normal[#]}&/@representationRoots[inducedAdjoint[seed]]],All]];adj=inducedAdjoint[out];Set[adjointRep[d[k]],adj];Set[cartan[d[k]],Module[{cartanMetric=repTrace[cartanGenerators[adj],2,False],invMetric},invMetric=inverse[cartanMetric];invMetric . SparseArray[DiagonalMatrix[(2/Normal@Diagonal[invMetric])]]]];Set[weightMetric[d[k]],Module[{cartan=repTrace[cartanGenerators[out],2,False]},(1/(2Max[#])DiagonalMatrix[#]) . cartan . ((DiagonalMatrix[#]))&@Diagonal[inverse@cartan]]];Set[killingMetric[d[k]],repTrace[out,2,False]];Set[tools`normalRepresentationQ[out],True];Set[tools`normalRepresentationQ[adj],True];Set[representationAlgebra[out],d[k]];Set[representationAlgebra[adj],d[k]];Set[tools`drawTensor[adj],tools`graphicalDotPower[adjointDynkinLabel[d[k]],3]];Set[tools`stylizedRepData[adj],{"ad","\[GothicG]",d[k],adjointDynkinLabel[d[k]],RGBColor[0.6,0.2,0.3]}];Set[tools`stylizedRepData[out],{"F","f",d[k],w[d]@@PadRight[{1},k],RGBColor[0.2,0.2,0.6]}];Set[tools`drawTensor[out],tools`graphicalDotPower[w[d]@@PadRight[{1},k],3]];out];
fundamentalRep[e[k_Integer]]/;MemberQ[Range[6,8],k]:=fundamentalRep[e[k]]=Module[{out=tools`parseRepresentationData[tools`eSeriesFundamentalRepData[[k-5]],Not[k===8]],adj},adj=inducedAdjoint[out];Set[adjointRep[e[k]],adj];Set[cartan[e[k]],Module[{cartanMetric=repTrace[cartanGenerators[adj],2,False],invMetric},invMetric=inverse[cartanMetric];invMetric . SparseArray[DiagonalMatrix[(2/Normal@Diagonal[invMetric])]]]];Set[weightMetric[e[k]],Module[{cart=repTrace[cartanGenerators[out],2,False]},(1/(2Max[#])DiagonalMatrix[#]) . cart . ((DiagonalMatrix[#]))&@Diagonal[inverse@cart]]];Set[killingMetric[e[k]],repTrace[out,2,False]];Set[tools`normalRepresentationQ[adj],True];Set[tools`normalRepresentationQ[out],True];Set[representationAlgebra[out],e[k]];Set[representationAlgebra[adj],e[k]];Set[tools`stylizedRepData[out],{"F","f",e[k],w[e]@@PadRight[{1},k],RGBColor[0.2,0.2,0.6]}];Set[tools`drawTensor[out],tools`graphicalDotPower[w[e]@@PadRight[{1},k],3]];Set[tools`drawTensor[adj],tools`graphicalDotPower[adjointDynkinLabel[e[k]],3]];Set[tools`stylizedRepData[adj],{"ad","\[GothicG]",e[k],adjointDynkinLabel[e[k]],RGBColor[0.6,0.2,0.3]}];out];
fundamentalRep[f[4]]:=fundamentalRep[f[4]]=Module[{out=tools`parseRepresentationData[{{},Uncompress["1:"]}],adj},adj=inducedAdjoint[out];Set[adjointRep[f[4]],adj];Set[cartan[f[4]],Module[{cartanMetric=repTrace[cartanGenerators[adj],2,False],invMetric},invMetric=inverse[cartanMetric];invMetric . SparseArray[DiagonalMatrix[(2/Normal@Diagonal[invMetric])]]]];Set[weightMetric[f[4]],Module[{cart=repTrace[cartanGenerators[out],2,False]},(1/(2Max[#])DiagonalMatrix[#]) . cart . ((DiagonalMatrix[#]))&@Diagonal[inverse@cart]]];Set[tools`normalRepresentationQ[out],True];Set[tools`normalRepresentationQ[adj],True];Set[representationAlgebra[out],f[4]];Set[representationAlgebra[adj],f[4]];Set[tools`stylizedRepData[out],{"F","f",f[4],w[f]@@PadRight[{1},4],RGBColor[0.2,0.2,0.6]}];Set[tools`drawTensor[out],tools`graphicalDotPower[w[f]@@PadRight[{1},4],3]];Set[tools`drawTensor[adj],tools`graphicalDotPower[adjointDynkinLabel[f[4]],3]];Set[tools`stylizedRepData[adj],{"ad","\[GothicG]",f[4],adjointDynkinLabel[f[4]],RGBColor[0.6,0.2,0.3]}];out];
