tools`clebschTensor[weightList__Integer,{legOrder__Integer}]/;(Sort[{legOrder}]===Range[Length[{legOrder}]]):=Module[{test=tools`clebschTensor[weightList,(2&/@Range[Length[{weightList}]+3]),{legOrder}]},If[Length[test["NonzeroValues"]]>0,test,tools`clebschTensor[weightList,{legOrder},Range[Length[{legOrder}]]]]];
